    {
      "id": "iobohjc",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2.1 Location and Area"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Telangana is located in south-central India on the Deccan Plateau. Its geographical coordinates are approximately 15°46'N to 19°54'N latitude and 77°16'E to 81°43'E longitude.",
      "id": "o2y1s0x"
    },
    {
      "id": "avk9u3i",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Parameter</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Details</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Total Area</p>",
            "<p>1,12,077 sq km (India's 11th largest state)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>North to South Extent</p>",
            "<p>Approximately 450 km</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>East to West Extent</p>",
            "<p>Approximately 560 km</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Borders</p>",
            "<p>Maharashtra &amp; Chhattisgarh (N), Andhra Pradesh (S &amp; E), Karnataka (W)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Population (2011)</p>",
            "<p>3.52 crore (India's 12th most populous state)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Districts</p>",
            "<p>33 (post-2016 reorganization)</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2o8gnsz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2.2 Physical Features"
    },
    {
      "id": "r18p4zo",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "2.2.1 Major Rivers"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Telangana is a land of rivers. Two of India's major rivers – the Godavari and the Krishna – flow through the state, making it an agricultural powerhouse.",
      "id": "un0kpuv"
    },
    {
      "id": "kyghx8d",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>River</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Origin</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Key Feature in Telangana</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Godavari</p>",
            "<p>Nashik, Maharashtra</p>",
            "<p>Largest river; enters at Mancherial; Kaleshwaram Project</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Krishna</p>",
            "<p>Mahabaleshwar, Maharashtra</p>",
            "<p>Srisailam Dam, Nagarjuna Sagar Dam on this river</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Bhima</p>",
            "<p>Western Ghats</p>",
            "<p>Tributary of Krishna; flows through Nalgonda</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Tungabhadra</p>",
            "<p>Karnataka</p>",
            "<p>Tributary of Krishna; Sangameswara Sangam</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Manair</p>",
            "<p>Karimnagar plateau</p>",
            "<p>Tributary of Godavari; Manair Dam</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Musi</p>",
            "<p>Near Vikarabad</p>",
            "<p>Passes through Hyderabad; Osman Sagar, Himayat Sagar</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Pranahita</p>",
            "<p>Junction of Wardha &amp; Wainganga</p>",
            "<p>Tributary of Godavari; forms northern boundary</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Indravati</p>",
            "<p>Odisha</p>",
            "<p>Tributary of Godavari in northern Telangana</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mgl1p2c",
