      "level": 3,
      "content": "2.2.2 Major Hills and Plateaus"
    },
    {
      "id": "u74lno3",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Deccan Plateau – Telangana lies entirely on the Deccan Plateau",
        "Nallamala Hills – Southern Telangana; part of Eastern Ghats",
        "Palamu Hills – Warangal and Karimnagar districts",
        "Mannanur Plateau – Mahabubnagar district",
        "Medak Plateau – Northwestern Telangana"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8o7k227",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "2.2.3 Soils"
    },
    {
      "id": "xxdf4w2",
